It's the difference between a pool and a moat (the depth of the water,
basically).  Some Quests with water features have shallow pools
(Barbarian, Healer, Knight, Samurai, Valkryie); some have deeper moats
(Archeologist, Rogue, Tourist, Wizard) that can't be dried up by fire.

